# Every .env variant, not just directories. This line was `.env.*/` — the
# trailing slash made it match DIRECTORIES only, so .env.local, .env.production
# and every other real dotfile variant was stageable. The bare `.env` above was
# the only thing standing between a local secrets file and a commit.
# The negation keeps the committed placeholder templates tracked.
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.*.example
Sprint*.md
~$*.md
ROLE*.md
*.pdf
!*.pdf.example
*.pem
*_Token*.txt
